# Advisories Trivy reports for the release that don't apply to it, each with
# the reason and a date to look again. govulncheck, which follows the calls,
# runs in CI as well and finds none of these reachable.

# golang.org/x/crypto/openpgp is deprecated and unmaintained. No Snugbox
# binary imports it; x/crypto reaches the release only through go-tuf's
# nacl/secretbox and scrypt. The advisory's only fix is an untagged commit
# after v0.58.0; take the next tagged x/crypto and drop this line.
